        "sid": "ROM 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I recommend to you our sister Phoebe, who serves the church at Cenchreae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Receive her in the Lord's name, as God's people should, and give her any help she may need from you; for she herself has been a good friend to many people and also to me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.18.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 18.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I send greetings to Priscilla and Aquila, my fellow-workers in the service of Christ Jesus; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they risked their lives for me. I am grateful to them — not only I, but all the Gentile churches as well. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Greetings also to the church that meets in their house.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Greetings to my dear friend Epaenetus, who was the first in the province of Asia to believe in Christ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Greetings to Mary, who has worked so hard for you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Greetings also to Andronicus and Junia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16.7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Junia",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Junias;",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "some manuscripts have",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Julia.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " fellow-Jews who were in prison with me; they are well known among the apostles, and they became Christians before I did.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My greetings to Ampliatus, my dear friend in the fellowship of the Lord. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Greetings also to Urbanus, our fellow-worker in Christ's service, and to Stachys, my dear friend. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Greetings to Apelles, whose loyalty to Christ has been proved. Greetings to those who belong to the family of Aristobulus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Greetings to Herodion, a fellow-Jew, and to the Christians in the family of Narcissus.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My greetings to Tryphaena and Tryphosa, who work in the Lord's service, and to my dear friend Persis, who has done so much work for the Lord. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.15.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 15.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I send greetings to Rufus, that outstanding worker in the Lord's service, and to his mother, who has always treated me like a son. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My greetings to Asyncritus, Phlegon, Hermes, Patrobas, Hermas, and all the other Christian brothers and sisters with them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Greetings to Philologus and Julia, to Nereus and his sister, to Olympas and to all of God's people who are with them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Greet one another with a holy kiss. All the churches of Christ send you their greetings.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I urge you, my brothers and sisters: watch out for those who cause divisions and upset people's faith and go against the teaching which you have received. Keep away from them! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For those who do such things are not serving Christ our Lord, but their own appetites. By their fine words and flattering speech they deceive innocent people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Everyone has heard of your loyalty to the gospel, and for this reason I am happy about you. I want you to be wise about what is good, but innocent in what is evil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And God, our source of peace, will soon crush Satan under your feet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The grace of our Lord Jesus be with you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16.20",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Some manuscripts omit this sentence.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.16.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 16.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timothy, my fellow-worker, sends you his greetings; and so do Lucius, Jason, and Sosipater, fellow-Jews.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I, Tertius, the writer of this letter, send you Christian greetings.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
